[47.559652, "i", "cat > /app/ipython/notes_for_testing.txt << 'EOF'\nIPython Library - Key Functions for Testing\n\nIPython is an interactive Python shell with advanced features.\n\nKey Functions and Modules to Test:\n1. InteractiveShell.run_cell() - Execute Python code in the shell\n2. InteractiveShell.run_code() - Run compiled code\n3. InputTransformer2.transform_cell() - Transform input before execution\n4. Completer.completions() - Code completion\n5. Completer.complete() - Get completions for a prefix\n6. PrefilterManager.prefilter() - Preprocess input commands\n7. PrefilterManager.prefilter_line() - Preprocess a single line\n8. compilerop.compile() - Compile Python code with custom error handling\n9. oinspect.Inspector.info() - Inspect Python objects\n10. oinspect.Inspector.pinfo() - Print object information\n11. formatters.PlainTextFormatter.format() - Format output\n12. guarded_eval.eval() - Safely evaluate expressions\n13. history.HistoryManager.get_tail() - Get history entries\n14. magic.Magics - Magic command system\n15. splitinput.spl"]
[47.559801, "i", "it_user_input() - Parse user input\n\nFuzzing Focus Areas:\n- Arbitrary Python code execution paths\n- Input transformer edge cases\n- Completion with malformed input\n- Magic command parsing\n- Unicode and special characters in code\n- Nested/recursive code structures\n- Exception handling edge cases\nEOF\n"]
[47.559872, "o", "cat > /app/ipython/notes_for_testing.txt << 'EOF'\r\n"]
